msgstr "Prisili popust za predčasno plačilo"

#. module: account_force_early_discount
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_force_early_discount.field_account_payment_register__force_early_discount
msgid ""
"Force early payment discount even if the date is past and the flag is not set on the invoices.\n"
"Note that early payment discounts will be applied for invoices havingthe flag set, even if this checkbox is not marked."
msgstr ""
"Prisili popust za predčasno plačilo, tudi če je rok že potekel in zastavica "
"na računih ni nastavljena.\n"
"Upoštevajte, da se bodo popusti za predčasno plačilo uporabili za račune, "
"pri katerih je zastavica nastavljena, tudi če to potrditveno polje ni "
"označeno."

#. module: account_force_early_discount
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_force_early_discount.field_account_bank_statement_line__force_early_discount
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_force_early_discount.field_account_move__force_early_discount
msgid ""
"If marked, early payment discount will be applied even if the discount date "
"is passed"
msgstr ""
"Če je označeno, se bo popust za predčasno plačilo uporabil tudi, če je datum "
"za popust že pretekel"

